-Schema is version-controlled at `backend/schema/schema.sql`, with incremental changes in `backend/schema/migrations/`. Reproduce locally:
+| Suite | Command | Tests |
+|---|---|---|
+| Logic (no database) | `pytest -m "not integration"` | 177 |
